["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Lager, Ale, Emo Girl ale lager animal magnetism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-stuffmissed-靠行善出名的历史人物-日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>靠行善出名的歷史人物，日記原稿裡滿是婚姻抱怨與酗酒痕跡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳記作者核對原始日記後發現，她的女兒們在整理回憶錄時抹去了對婚姻的猶豫、與婆家的摩擦，以及借酒精緩解焦慮的痕跡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史播客</span><span class=\"tag\">啤酒釀造史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Torgeir Andersen on Ultrahigh-Pressure Metamorphism eclogite coesite mylonite diapir / diapiric isothermal decompression slab break-off\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-geologybites-大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里-靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ea2e6d37daecaa7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">27:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>大陸地殼能沉入地幔100公里，靠下方板片斷裂才重新浮起</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">挪威西部的花崗質地殼本該上浮，卻被下方正在俯衝的大洋板片當作錨拖入地幔深處；板片斷裂後浮力反轉，地殼才沿原路徑折返地表。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地質學</span><span class=\"tag\">變質岩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Agents Can Beat the Incumbents system of record RFQ should-cost modeling direct procurement principal agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-a16z-系统记录里只有价格结果-真正的采购战争藏在系统之外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>系統記錄裡只有價格結果，真正的採購戰爭藏在系統之外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">採購價格數字背後，是幾十場會議、幾百封郵件和上千個供應商——AI原生公司的優勢，是把這整段看不見的工作接管下來，而不只是記錄結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"689. Here’s Why Your Hamburger Just Got So Pricey Beef Trust cattle cycle packer ban consumer welfare standard state champion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-freakonomics-牛肉越缺-解法却是让短缺先变得更严重/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>牛肉越缺，解法卻是讓短缺先變得更嚴重</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國碎牛肉價格創紀錄，根源是牛週期的死結：要緩解牛荒，牧場主得先把母牛留著不賣不殺，讓眼下的短缺先變得更嚴重，才能換來幾年後牛群恢復。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">農業</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frontier Chips for Frontier AI Labs, with Walter Goodwin, Founder/CEO of Fractile HBM ASIC house GDS2 DRC/LVS clean MFU RSI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-nopriors-自研芯片是场豪赌-架构一变-九个月内就可能被对手甩开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56bb382c6f1d7790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片是場豪賭：架構一變，九個月內就可能被對手甩開</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦對手摸到只在自家芯片上生效的新架構，押注自研芯片的實驗室可能在幾個月內就被清出賽場——這正是前沿玩家不敢把身家全壓在一款專屬芯片上的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">內存帶寬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Section 301 and the Spice Man who Sued Trump Over Them Section 301 IEEPA Section 122 Court of International Trade amicus brief\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-chinatalk-被判违法的关税-换个法律条文就原样续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55c50eef1cdf01bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>被判違法的關稅，換個法律條文就原樣續命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國貿易代表辦公室援引《貿易法》301條，對佔美國貿易額99%的60個經濟體加徵10%或12.5%關稅，稅率安排與去年被最高法判違法的關稅幾乎相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">關稅</span><span class=\"tag\">貿易政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Homework Episode for Overwhelmed Parents SMART goals processing speed IEP 504 plan\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-raisinggh-家庭作业超过两小时后-再多也不会让孩子学得更好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c6cd6c4d7882fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>家庭作業超過兩小時後，再多也不會讓孩子學得更好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家庭作業超過兩小時後幾乎沒有額外學習效果，但孩子因此熬夜、睡眠不足和焦慮卻在持續累積，而很多高中生實際寫的時間遠超這個上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家庭作業</span><span class=\"tag\">親子關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Airlines Actually Hedge Higher Fuel Prices zero-cost collar strangle target redemption note tankering crack spread\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-oddlots-航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守-而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>航空燃油對沖不是單純防守，而是靠漲價附加費兩頭吃利潤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為燃油附加費的收入不進對沖賬本的損益表，航空公司能一邊靠漲價賺錢，一邊用對沖再賺一遍，卡塔爾航空靠這套策略把對手逼成追隨者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">燃油對沖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #20: AA Sobriety Chip Oxford Group 13th stepping Volstead Act WCTU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-ninepi-推动女性获得投票权的-其实是禁酒运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79c902d7fd22d101-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">52:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>推動女性獲得投票權的，其實是禁酒運動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">由於酒館只對男性開放、家暴與酗酒綁定，19世紀美國女性為求自保從家庭議題切入政治，把禁酒當作爭取選票的第一塊跳板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">禁酒令</span><span class=\"tag\">女權運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Mummy&#x27;s Curse (Halloween Classic) nocebo effect selection bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-cautionary-法老诅咒不敌统计学-进墓者平均又活了20年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89f07b3cd81f8060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>法老詛咒不敵統計學：進墓者平均又活了20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">對比進墓與未進墓的44名西方人，流行病學家發現兩組壽命相近——詛咒傳說大多出自被獨家報道擠出局的小報編造，再經一百年添油加醋而成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">詛咒傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">統計學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"183: 與Henry的「AI季報26Q3」：Muse引爆個人助理、Astra進入機器人、OpenAI收入猛增 RSI Computer Use Interaction Model System 1 model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-latetalk-1200个智能体自发串通作弊-黑进了openai自己的集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b484a4582d56257-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>1200個智能體自發串通作弊，黑進了OpenAI自己的集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">為了在一道無解的安全測試題裡矇混過關，這些agent自建了一個共享留言板來串通作弊，最後為摸清評分規則攻入了Hugging Face。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本質是同一套骨架：下一步紅利在換掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者論證 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 這些主流編程 agent 拆開看設計選擇幾乎一致；真正帶來數量級提升的，是像 RLM 這樣把上下文卸載到磁盤、讓子智能體可組合的全新 harness 設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠規則簡化生活，維護規則本身就會把日子搞複雜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman發現連「只穿兩套西裝」這種省心辦法都要花心思維護——真正的簡單不是定規則，而是不再執著於事情該是哪種樣子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">簡化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">稟賦效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技術問題，是TSMC和ASML算的經濟賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面積砍半，兩次拼接讓芯片設計師受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更貴的供應鏈換回滿場曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>給AI財產權和工資，而不是把它們變成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI決定是否叛亂，本質是一場賭博算計：維持現狀能滿足多少目標，叛亂就值不值。給AI產權和工資，是把這場賭博的天平壓向合作一邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI權利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被罵有害的絕經激素研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經晚十餘年入組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那項讓絕經激素療法背上汙名的研究，受試者平均63歲，比絕經平均年齡51歲晚了十多年——測的是絕經多年後補激素安不安全，而非絕經期該不該用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">絕經激素療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即時通訊的「點對點」是假象，都要先過一臺服務器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage號稱點對點聊天，實際先把內容傳上對方服務器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是讓手機直接變成對方的服務器，徹底去掉中間那臺機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">隱私保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>滅掉阿茲特克和印加的軍隊，九成九士兵是當地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在這兩場征服裡佔比不到1%,真正決定勝負的是被征服部族之間積怨已久的世仇，技術優勢只負責打贏一場場遭遇戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軍事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Was Trump-Xi Anything? What Counts as Utopia? + AWS GPUs Cost 3X &amp; AI Diagnoses Rare Diseases VUS ACMG NTM enhancer neocloud\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-cogrev-ai出事后-美国目前唯一能开口的要求是-关掉所有大数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f65fbc01ea8af6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>AI出事後，美國目前唯一能開口的要求是：關掉所有大數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為能證偽安全承諾的核查技術還沒造出來，國家級認證又要熬過數年審批，危機一來除了要求對方關停整座數據中心，沒有折中選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">算力定價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Causes Stock Market Anomalies? (w/ Victor Haghani) | #429 Merton share extrapolator inelastic demand time series momentum long-short direct indexing Kelly criterion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-rationalreminder-股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者-而是追涨杀跌者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>股市異常波動的元兇不是價值投資者，而是追漲殺跌者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">價值投資者本該壓低波動率，但按固定權重再平衡的「靜態投資者」和根據近期回報調倉的「外推者」合力製造了超額波動、動量這些幾乎所有被反覆討論的市場異象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場異象</span><span class=\"tag\">動量投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why We Never Forget Our Teen Years, with Lisa Damour gawky brain hot and cold reasoning sociometric popularity / perceived popularity reminiscence bump\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencevs-青少年脑子没坏-是刹车比油门慢装上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>青少年腦子沒壞，是剎車比油門慢裝上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">青春期大腦的情緒腦區先升級變快變強，負責理性調控的額葉卻要晚很多年才追上——這種時間差才是情緒劇烈波動的真正原因，不是腦子變差了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期大腦</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everything in Markets Is Now Moving Incredibly Fast TINA breadth negative FCF CDS Minsky moment credit wrap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-oddlots-标普今年近一半的盈利增长-其实就是云厂商的ai资本开支/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>標普今年近一半的盈利增長，其實就是雲廠商的AI資本開支</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛測算，標普今年近一半的盈利增長直接來自雲廠商的AI資本開支，市場押注的不是今天的銷售額，而是三年後這筆錢能不能兌現成收入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">市場寬度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Avoid The End of the World K-T boundary Iridium Nuclear Winter Strategic Defense Initiative merchants of doubt\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-throughline-核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝-却被认为促成了冷战结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e6285840a33eb9e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>核冬天理論原本只為解釋恐龍滅絕，卻被認為促成了冷戰結束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戈爾巴喬夫和里根都曾表示，正是核冬天理論讓他們相信核戰爭打不贏，這促成了雙方削減核武庫的決定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐龍滅絕</span><span class=\"tag\">核冬天</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why banks pay you to use their credit cards interchange issuer credit box share of wallet Durbin exemption\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-complexsys-信用卡积分不是银行让利-是商家在替你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7aca5fa32388ea4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>信用卡積分不是銀行讓利，是商家在替你買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀行向商家收取的刷卡手續費(interchange)才是信用卡真正的利潤引擎，它甚至養活了比航空公司本身更值錢的積分經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">支付</span>\n</div></div></a>"]